Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:10.22,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 多伦多 WTA1000 第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:10.22,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}伊埃拉 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-1 4-6 6-2{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 帕克斯 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.32,0:00:04.92,EN,,0,0,0,,They're everywhere you go now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.32,0:00:04.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,走到哪里，都能看到他们，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.92,0:00:07.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and it just keeps getting bigger and bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.92,0:00:07.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,球迷越来越多，声势也更旺。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:10.04,EN,,0,0,0,,How good does it feel playing in front of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:10.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,每次你站上球场，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.04,0:00:12.04,EN,,0,0,0,,this atmosphere every single time you step
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.04,0:00:12.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,都能在这样的氛围中打球，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.04,0:00:12.76,EN,,0,0,0,,on court?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.04,0:00:12.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:14.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I am eternally grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:14.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我永远心怀感激。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.80,0:00:16.96,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, I just came off Washington,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.80,0:00:16.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我刚刚从华盛顿站走来，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:22.16,EN,,0,0,0,,so I really feel like this is a celebration.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:22.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以这就像一场庆祝。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.44,0:00:50.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you everybody who is here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.44,0:00:50.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢今晚到场的每一位朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.88,0:00:51.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.88,0:00:51.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.80,0:00:54.28,EN,,0,0,0,,to everyone who's supporting tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.80,0:00:54.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,也谢谢所有支持网球的人，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.24,EN,,0,0,0,,and creating atmospheres like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,是你们创造了这样热烈的氛围。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:00:59.52,EN,,0,0,0,,It's really the pleasure of my life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:00:59.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,能够经历这一切，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.52,0:01:02.48,EN,,0,0,0,,to experience these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.52,0:01:02.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的是我人生中的莫大快乐。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:03.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Alex, it's been a real pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:03.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯，今晚见到你真好。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.72,0:01:05.00,EN,,0,0,0,,We'll see you tomorrow. We know you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.72,0:01:05.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们明天再见。我们知道，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:06.36,EN,,0,0,0,,joining forces with Venus
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:06.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,你明天将和维纳斯搭档，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.36,0:01:06.88,EN,,0,0,0,,when you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.36,0:01:06.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,一起出战。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:07.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Cannot wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:07.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们已经等不及了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.84,0:01:10.22,EN,,0,0,0,,Alexandra Eala, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.84,0:01:10.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,掌声送给伊埃拉！
